<mxCell id="p0b21" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:21.0px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;노드 M대&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;border-top:1px solid #A19E9A;margin:0 auto;height:0;width:170px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:21.0px;padding-top:3px&quot;&gt;클러스터 ASN&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=cube;size=10;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;darkOpacity2=0.12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8E4DE;strokeColor=#A19E9A;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=16.0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=2;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1150" y="470" width="180" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0b22" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:19.0px&quot;&gt;구성&lt;br&gt;· underlay : 링크 /31 eBGP, 루프백 · VTEP 광고&lt;br&gt;· overlay : l2vpn evpn eBGP, spine 은 next-hop unchanged&lt;br&gt;· 계층별 ASN : super spine / spine Pod 별 / leaf 랙 별 / 노드 클러스터 별&lt;br&gt;· 전 계층 maximum-paths 64 + multipath-relax&lt;br&gt;· BFD (패브릭 링크), 노드 구간은 timers 3 9&lt;br&gt;효과&lt;br&gt;· RR · IGP 없음 → 경로 숨김 · cost 문제 원천 제거&lt;br&gt;· 장비 1대 장애 = 그 세션만 영향&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D9DECF;strokeColor=#5F8B5A;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=14.0;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="556" width="620" height="284" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
